---
const { status } = Astro.props;
const label = status === 'draft' ? 'Draft' : 'Sample';
---

<aside class="sample-banner" role="note">
  <p>
    <strong>{label} template.</strong> Demo products are fictional (Example Brand, product ids starting with demo-).
    This page is not a review, a ranking, a price, or a recommendation. It is excluded from the sitemap and marked noindex.
  </p>
</aside>
